{"id":"oz4za4skp5htqq8cxjfkfdzen","title":"Meta 扩展 LLDB 支持跨 CPU/GPU 应用调试","originalTitle":"Extending LLDB to Debug Applications That Span CPUs and GPUs","summary":"Meta 开发了 LLDB 扩展架构，支持跨 CPU 和 GPU 应用的调试，并已部分上游至 LLVM。该架构通过分离共享调试器基础设施与硬件特定控制，将 CPU 和 GPU 作为独立调试目标呈现，同时保持统一工作流。测试验证了架构的通用性，目前已有部分代码上游至 LLVM。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://engineering.fb.com/2026/11/09/developer-tools/extending-lldb-to-debug-applications-that-span-cpus-and-gpus/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T00:48:14.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T07:41:40.055Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T00:48:14.000Z","category":"dev-tools","tags":["技术方案","教程与观点","GitHub"],"score":63,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}